=2 Walkthrough
__The quest {q:For Want of a Pot|For Want of a Pot|For Want of a Pot} in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} must be completed in order to start this quest. That being said, fame level 3 in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} is also required.__
* Speak to {p:Teigero-Bangero (A)} at (E-7) to begin the quest.
** Conflux #8 is closest, head southwest through the Helter-Skelters and Speltercaps.
** You will receive a {@k} {k:Smudged letter}.
* Travel to {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} and deliver the {@k} {k:Smudged letter} to {p:Naruru (A)} at the entrance.
** She will give you a {@k} {k:Yellow linkpearl}.
* Return to {p:Teigero-Bangero (A)} in {z:Abyssea - Vunkerl} and speak to him to complete the quest.

=3 Further, optional rewards
* After completing the quest, head to {z:Abyssea - Misareaux}. You are looking for {p:Panta-Putta (A)}.
** It is recommended to use {p:Widescan}. He roams a very wide area. He makes a round trip from Conflux #00 > #04 > #07 > Repeat
* Trade him the {@i:Taru Tot Toyset|441} {i:Taru Tot Toyset|Taru Tot Toyset|441} to receive a {@k} {k:Jester's hat}.
** The {@i:Taru Tot Toyset|441} {i:Taru Tot Toyset|Taru Tot Toyset|441} __will not be lost__.
* Finally return to {p:Naruru (A)} in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} to trade the {@k} {k:Jester's hat} for a {@i:Jester's Hat|11788} {i:Jester's Hat|Jester's Hat|11788}.

